# Catalog and copy

## `transporters.json`

Array of carriers. Keep existing field names:

| Field | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `id` | Unique number |
| `name` | Short slug/brand shown in the list |
| `logo` | Image URL |
| `url` | External company site (list rows link here) |
| `phone` | Display string, typically `+38 …` |
| `departure` / `destination` | Ukrainian place names |
| `description` | Ukrainian one-liner |
| `price` | e.g. `від 50€` |
| `schedule` | e.g. `щодня` |
| `type` | e.g. `мікроавтобус` |
| `rating` | Number |

Add new carriers as another object with a new `id`. Do not rename keys (list/search depend on them). Search currently filters `name` with `.includes(term)` (case-sensitive substring).

## `content.json`

Nested copy under `pages.*`. `AboutPage` reads `pages.about.title`, `subtitle`, `content`, `mission[]`. Add parallel keys when adding pages; keep Ukrainian.
